    "notes": "Fuselage length runs from the nose tip to the fin trailing-edge tip (fixed structure; the tail rotor disc reaches 0.39 m further aft). Height is to the top of the rotor-head cap. Cabin width is the body skin; door rails and handles stand up to 25 mm proud of it.",
